# Project standing orders

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [CLAUDE.md](../../CLAUDE.md) before project work.

Decision records live under `.agents/notes/{lifecycle}/{class}/yyyy-mm-dd-slug.md`. Do not write them to `Ai-notes/` (gitignored). Do not restructure `docs/`.

After note edits, run `python scripts/verify_template.py` and report the result. Failures are errors, not hints.
